#: ../../source/docs/common-cabling-guide.rst:5
#: 2f34ce72755b45488d9ec336e92aae69
msgid "Cable Design Guidelines"
msgstr "线缆设计指南"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cabling-guide.rst:6
#: 5ae2f77e3dc24d78bb241adf849d1ca5
msgid ""
"This guide provides detailed recommendations for cabling with a focus on "
"signal integrity, electromagnetic compatibility, wire color conventions, "
"connector standards, and best practices for specific signals like I2C and "
"CAN. These practices help ensure reliable operation, simplify debugging, and"
" improve documentation clarity across unmanned platforms of all sizes."
msgstr ""
"本指南提供线缆设计的详细建议，重点关注信号完整性、电磁兼容性、导线颜色规范、连接器标准，以及I2C和CAN等特定信号的最佳实践。这些规范有助于确保可靠运行、简化调试，并提高各类规模无人机平台文档的清晰度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cabling-guide.rst:9
#: 73012d82a9944659a69f3da899594425
msgid "Cable Colour Coding"
msgstr "线缆颜色编码"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cabling-guide.rst:10
#: b7b9540e0e2a48b8bb0d4b8c6e04468d
msgid ""
"A consistent cable colour-coding system is useful for correct assembly and "
"maintenance. It also improves clarity in documentation and field repairs."
msgstr "一致的线缆颜色编码系统有助于正确装配和维护，同时提高文档和现场维修的清晰度。"

